<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Plant</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Thief (guild level 25)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>plant &lt;item&gt; on &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>plant dagger on guard
</pre>
<p>Slips something you carry onto someone else, without their noticing: a 
stolen jewel onto an innocent, perhaps. It costs a little endurance, and 
you must be standing.
</p><p>Your skill and dexterity work against your mark's dexterity and wits. 
Fail, and the item slips from your hands to the floor, in full view of 
your mark. Succeed only just, and you plant it clumsily: it is theirs now, 
but they notice. A clean plant goes unseen. You can't plant anything on 
someone whose hands are full, or who can carry no more.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
